    "body": "I believe the implementation in Chromium is currently implementing the first half of the requirement without considering the multipliers. It hasn't come up in practice to my knowledge because High-Speed, High-Bandwidth endpoints are relatively rare.\n\nThe key thing for developers using the API is that the packet size informs how data should be chunked since devices may consider a transfer complete when a packet with less than the maximum packet size is transmitted. I need to do additional research to recall how that applies to these packet bursts supported by High-Speed and SuperSpeed devices.",
